Features to add/Improvements to make:
- it is currently at or near production state
- watch the runs and after monitoring a while come up with refinements

How it currently works:
- download fundamentals from yfinance
- compute qvm scores with q 45, v 10, m 45 weights
- choose the top 75 qvm scorers
- call gemini 2.5 to get market and world news context
- call gemini 2.5 in batches to get stock research and news
- give research to gemini 3.5 for classification of continuation and risk
- gemini's returns and risk events may not match for python use, use embeddings and semantic similarity to reconcile meanings instead of word comparisons
- python changes scores based on research, selects the top 10, limits amount per sector and risk event
- generates web page
- results after calls are cached every step to prevent costly repeated calls, also repaired if gemini's returns are bad
- extensive logging so that chatgpt can analyze the operational robustness and results and suggest refinements, fixes, changes, etc
- automated to run at lowest gemini usage to avoid 503s
- philosophy: find stocks that are at least as good as the benchmark etfs (spmo, vgt, divb, vflo), are doing well and will continue to do well, wont go negative after buying
